 need a do-over  it's possible we don't want to wait  around for the courts  for however long it'll take to tell us  so it's possible we can figure this out  on our own  that we we might actually just need to  have another election anyway  those who are voting have two weeks  remaining to get their ballots in the  mail  ross lord global news the standing  committee on canadian heritage held a  virtual meeting to discuss  bill c-10 also known as the bill to  modernize the broadcasting act  several key players in the industry  including chorus entertainment which  owns global news  took part bill c-10 is not perfect but  it gets one big thing right it will  finally bring foreign digital  broadcasters into the regulatory fold  and start to level the playing field for  canadian media  and for us this is reason enough to  support it  the long-anticipated legislation was  introduced last november  it's the first in a three-pronged  government approach to regulate online  streaming services  and their influence in canada  conspiracy warning still ahead the  infodemic  emerging from the pandemic  what's historic about the pandemic we  are in now is the use of technology and  social media on a massive scale to keep  the public informed  but those platforms are also being used  to spread disinformation  and conspiracies about the virus jeff  semple has more on how canadians can  break the chain  of misinformation dr joy hatley  is fighting covet 19 on two fronts  caring for patients at this ontario  hospital  while also battling a parallel pandemic  why do you lie on your news  of disinformation claims kovid 19 is a  hoax  it's now affecting my ability to care  for my patients because  there's a trust factor and there's an  uncertainty on their part  it's a topic of conversation at most  dinner tables  including her own hatley started hearing  covet conspiracies  from members of her own family her  father  sharing videos like this one it's about  creating fear  so that people will not ask any  questions with widely debunked claims  that the kovit 19 test  is fake and that bill gates is secretly  inserting trackable microchips into the  vaccines  so i went back to my dad and i said dad  i'm sorry to worry about you  like that's just nuts because people are  afraid this expert in conspiracies  says that the pandemic has produced a  perfect storm of fear  frustration and isolation with more time  spent online it's not people who are  uneducated or  people who are you know on the lowest  end of the social economic  tiers it's people everywhere that are  being  brought into this the covid conspiracy  super spreaders  include an eclectic mix of anti-vaxxers  as well as anti-immigrant and far-right  hate groups  and much of their disinformation is now  focused on vaccines  we've picked up the chinese basically  spreading  falsehoods about western vaccines that  they can't be trusted  i think the wider concern is that if  these groups continue  what impact will that have on canadians  wanting to get vaccinated  dr hatley says that's what worries her  the most  and you think this can't happen in  canada how does this happen  in our country conspiracy theories  thought to exist on the fringes  are reaching into the homes of ordinary  canadians  threatening to undermine the pandemic  response  jeff semple global news toronto  and be sure to tune in to jeff's story  on the new reality he speaks to a young  woman whose mother became a conspiracy  theorist  during the pandemic that's tomorrow at 7  pm right here on global  up next decoding in different dimensions  how earthlings solve the puzzle  on mars  when nasa successfully landed  perseverance on mars  the space agency hinted there was a  secret message hidden inside the rover's  red and white parachute  that sent internet sloughs into a  tailspin to try  to solve it well our eric sorensen  caught up with the college student from  france  who cracked the code he chilled up  the images were extra